        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.17.1+ISA.17.2+ISA.17.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 17.1–3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.1.3+AMO.1.4+AMO.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amos 1.3–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zech 9.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said about Damascus: “The people in the cities of Hamath and Arpad are worried and troubled because they have heard bad news. Anxiety rolls over them like a sea, and they cannot rest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Damascus are weak and have fled in terror. They are in pain and misery like a woman in labour. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The famous city that used to be happy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49.25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some ancient translations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "happy",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "my happiness.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is completely deserted. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On that day her young men will be killed in the city streets, and all her soldiers destroyed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will set the walls of Damascus on fire and will burn down King Benhadad's palaces. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty, have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said about the tribe of Kedar and the districts controlled by Hazor, which were conquered by King Nebuchadnezzar of Babylonia: “Attack the people of Kedar and destroy that tribe of eastern people! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seize their tents and their flocks, their tent curtains and everything in their tents. Take their camels and tell the people, ‘Terror is all round you!’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“People of Hazor, I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", warn you to run far away and hide. King Nebuchadnezzar of Babylonia has plotted against you, and this is what he says, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Come on! We'll attack those people that feel safe and secure! Their city has no gates or locks and is completely unprotected.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Take their camels and all their livestock! I will scatter in every direction those people who cut their hair short, and I will bring disaster on them from every side. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazor will be made a desert for ever, a place where only jackals live. No one will ever live there again. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soon after Zedekiah became king of Judah, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty spoke to me about the country of Elam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said, “I will kill all the archers who have made Elam so powerful. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make winds blow against Elam from all directions, and I will scatter her people everywhere, until there is no country where her refugees have not gone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make the people of Elam afraid of their enemies, who want to kill them. In my great anger I will destroy the people of Elam and send armies against them until I have wiped them out. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will destroy their kings and leaders, and set up my throne there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But later on I will make the people of Elam prosperous again. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
